{"ref":"BDB, שָׂבְעָה","hw":"שָׂבְעָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂבְעָה</span></big>  <span dir=\"rtl\">[שִׂבְעָה]</span> <strong>n.f. satiety</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.11\">Is 56:11</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂבְעַת־</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.49\">Ez 16:49</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂבְעָתֵךְ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.28\">28</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  as to food, especially <span dir=\"rtl\">אָכַל לְשׂ׳</span> <em>eat to satiety, one’s fill</em>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.18\">Is 23:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.19\">Ez 39:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לְשׂ׳</span> also <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.2\">Is 55:2</a> (fig.); <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> of dogs <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.11\">56:11</a> (fig.); <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳־לֶחֶם</span> leading to arrogance, as sin of Sodom <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.49\">Ez 16:49</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּאוֹן</span>, etc.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  as to carnal desire <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.28\">Ez 16:28</a> (fig.).","next":"BDB, שָׂבָע","prev":"BDB, שֹׂ֫בַע"}